From: Flax <flax@flax.local>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: aspeed: tiogapass: use 64MB flash layout

TiogaPass uses a 64MB SPI flash. Switch from the default 32MB flash
layout to openbmc-flash-layout-64.dtsi.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [machine-specific configuration]

---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
index abcdef0..1234567 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@
 	flash@0 {
 		status = "okay";
 		m25p,fast-read;
-#include "openbmc-flash-layout.dtsi"
+#include "openbmc-flash-layout-64.dtsi"
 	};
 };

